# Claude Code: per-machine state, never committed. Subagent memory can quote what an
# agent learned from real exports, so it stays local (same rule as the hydrex repos).
# The rest of .claude/ stays visible, so a shared setting or agent can be committed.
.claude/agent-memory/
.claude/settings.local.json
